<title>USA: Goodrich to sell electrical aero engine unit.</title>
<headline>Goodrich to sell electrical aero engine unit.</headline>
<dateline>RICHFIELD, Ohio 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BF Goodrich Co is to sell its aerospace engine electrical systems division to Unison Industries for an undisclosed sum, Goodrich said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Goodrich said in a statement that the division, which is headquartered in Norwich, NY, had sales of $60 million in 1996 out of a total of $2.2 billion.</p>
<p>Unison said the acquisition would double sales. ((--New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
